            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "Thanks for explaining this. My common workflow is to triple-quote a string:\r\n```python\r\nq = select a from b\r\n# to\r\nq = \"\"\"select a from b\"\"\"\r\n```\r\nor sometimes more complicated\r\n```python\r\n'''abc'''\r\n# to\r\n\"\"\"abc\"\"\"\r\n\r\nabc\r\n# to\r\n[\"abc\"]\r\n```\r\nIn viscode and sublime, it would be a simple selection and type. Can you please provide some suggestions on this kind of scenario?",
